## 1.3.3
- Update dialog redesigned: release notes shown as "What's new", **Update** / **Update later** buttons, light + dark variant, link to the releases page
- Dark mode completed: custom dark scrollbars (config editor, server log, lists, chat), dark tab strip/page frame, dark drop-downs and status bar
- Scenario & Mods: removed the popup shown on every tab open; global mods in `Content\Mods` can be disabled/enabled via checkbox (`Content\Mods.disabled`)
- ListView: last column fills the width, dark selection highlight

## 1.3.1
- In-game chat window (reads player chat from the log, reply as SERVER or custom name, unread counter)
- Scheduled auto save & restart with player warning and optional backup
- Dark mode

## 1.2.3
- Auto-update from GitHub releases with SHA-256 verification and self-restart; manual check via status bar

## 1.2.2
- Launch Game button; Connect Info (local / LAN / VPN / public) with copy buttons
- Fixed "Activation error" on join (server runs with SteamAppId 383120)

## 1.2.0
- Portable install, SteamCMD-based server download/update, full offline bundle
- Scenario dropdown from Content\Scenarios + Steam Workshop, DLL mod checkboxes, native .exe launcher

## 1.1.0
- Multi-server profiles, per-server mods, live save backups, Donate button

## 1.0.0
- Initial resizable launcher with Save & Restart
